<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner 1996 profits per division.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner 1996 profits per division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results by division at Norwegian shipbuilding, engineering and construction group Kvaerner ASA for the 12 months to December 31.</p>
<p>			     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating result</p>
<p>  Shipbuilding		   1,103    vs	 1,634</p>
<p>  Process			     89    vs	   -</p>
<p>  Construction		     110    vs	   -</p>
<p>  Oil &amp; gas		minus    18    vs	   257</p>
<p>  Metals				94    vs	   -</p>
<p>  Pulping		  minus   521    vs   minus 322</p>
<p>  Other activities		 173    vs	   393</p>
<p>Pre-tax result</p>
<p>  Shipbuilding		  1,027	vs	 1,524</p>
<p>  Process			   145	vs	   -</p>
<p>  Construction		     32	vs	   -</p>
<p>  Oil &amp; gas		minus   33	vs	   276</p>
<p>  Metals			    100	vs	   -</p>
<p>  Pulping		  minus  266	vs  minus  178</p>
<p>  Other activities     minus  255	vs	   813</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
